{
  "title": "Steps to Enable the Team Item for an ItemType",
  "html": "<html><head></head><body><div>\n  <div class=\"WordSection1\">\n    <h1>Steps to Enable the Team Item for an Item Type (Administrators Only)</h1>\n    <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Note\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; \n                                         list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n      <p class=\"Note\"><i style=\"font-style: italic; mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">These steps describe exposing the ‘</span><span class=\"SpellE\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">team_id</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">’ system property on a form for an ItemType.</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">They are generic and apply to any ItemType in the system.</span></i></p>\n      <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n        <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n          <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"margin-top: 9.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo10;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">View the form (edit mode) for the ItemType to which you wish to provide users the ability to use the team item.</span></p>\n          <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n            <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n              <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"margin-top: 9.0pt; margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo10;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Add the ‘<span class=\"SpellE\">team_id</span>’ system property to the form.</span>\n              </p>\n              <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n                <p class=\"Content_body_indented\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; mso-fareast-language: ZH-TW;\"><img src=\"/aras-images/teamform.jpg\"></p>\n                <!--?rh-list_start level=\"1\" an=\"1\" class=\"rl-p-Figure_indented\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; \n                                         list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n                  \n                  <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n                    <!--?rh-list_start class=\"Numbered_list\" style=\"list-style: rh-list; list-style: rh-list;\" ?-->\n                      <p class=\"Numbered\" style=\"mso-list: l8 level1 lfo10;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Save the form.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>Users may now associate a Team to instances of the ItemType.</span>\n                      </p>\n                      <!--?rh-list_end ?-->\n  </div>\n\n</div></body></html>",
  "sourceFile": "enable_the_team.htm"
}